{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","亚莉克希"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名能将羽翼化作翼弓的射手，能够赋予友军权能并共同攻击锁定的敌人。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","需要帮忙？没问题！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I've got your back!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","神圣之力，愈发辉煌！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The divine light grows brighter!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","正义之箭将洗刷你的罪孽！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","The arrow of justice will purge your sins!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我怎么能……倒在这里……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I can't... I can't fall here..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","这种时候，该庆祝一番吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","That calls for a celebration. Don't you think?"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","清除邪恶，正是我的使命！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Purge the wicked, that's my sacred duty!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嗯，感觉不错。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Yeah, that felt good!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","来欣赏一场表演吧！怎么样？有趣吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","No evil will escape this bow of judgement!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","以神圣之弓，审判一切邪秽！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Behold, a divine performance. How's that for entertainment?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","神的圣辉真让人温暖啊……多谢了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","真有趣，凡人都喜欢这种东西？我会好好研究一下的。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","污秽之物。快拿远些吧，我可不想用弓箭对准你的手心。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","品尝美食真是一种享受"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真热闹啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","和谁聊聊比较好呢？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","和其他神兵不同，亚莉克希对凡人的生活十分好奇，甚至会主动融入各地的种族和阵营，和当地人打成一片。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","亚莉克希的翼弓远比看上去更重。巴赫朗曾经试图将其拿起，不出意料，他失败了。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","亚莉克希喜欢模仿凡人的用词。在最开始的时候，她曾经惹出不少笑话。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","在飞行速度的比拼上，亚莉克希从来没有赢过阿塔利娅。为此她经常开玩笑地说，如果她是由一支箭创造而出的就好了。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","亚莉克希认为自己全身上下最美丽的地方是眼睛——一旦邪恶出现，即使在最遥远的地方，她也能借助这双眼睛锁定对方的位置。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","进行武器保养时，亚莉克希常常为翼弓的复杂结构头疼不已。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","在学会“冰块脸”这个词之后，亚莉克希常常用这个词来形容她的神兵同伴。幸运的是，因为其他神兵大都是冰块脸，所以她的行为没有遭到抗议。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","在诸多半神中，亚莉克希是萨基塔里斯唯一不会主动邀请饮酒作乐的那位，因为亚莉克希拥有能把他喝到意识模糊的酒量。虽然实际上，亚莉克希并不喜欢饮酒。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","亚莉克希非常理解凡人为何向自己许愿。因此，只要愿望在她力所能及的范围内，她都会尽力帮忙。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","无论亚莉克希心情多好，她都会尽力克制自己，不让自己放声大笑。她过于豪放的笑声有时会引起一些不必要的注意。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","我在萨洛克兰见过许多一直戴着面具的人，这是某种必要的社交礼仪吗？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415711.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","亚莉克希 & 沙利叶"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","品尝美食真是一种享受"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415727.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","亚莉克希"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","真热闹啊！"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415728.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","亚莉克希"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","阿妮芮尔……你是阿妮芮尔！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415807.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","亚莉克希 & 恩妮瑞尔"]]}